Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing That
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,surely someday we just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A brat who turned into a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the boy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know about that, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, to tell the truth,\NI saw it all happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I decided not to\Ntell anybody about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,because we weren't\Nsupposed to be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here on the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saw him change, it scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This laboratory is big,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's got lots of treatment\Nrooms scattered throughout it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just being kept in a different\Npart of the lab, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know if he's had something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why but he\Nwouldn't even touch his food,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, we got him to start eating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about him;\Nhe's doing just fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,don't tell anyone about the\Nboy of the secret room—not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,even the other kids—it'll\Nbe our little secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the big idea, bird lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like my 10 layer igloo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a bit thicker than the\Nlast one, isn't it? You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it's much harder to break through the snow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,walls when they're layered\Non top of one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to\Nbuy time, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing can't hold me—you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you could probably break through\Nall the snow walls in a matter of seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you agree, then why even father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that I'm losing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle as I may; I have no chance\Nof ever beating you. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes it's the smartest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,not the strongest, who wins the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't push
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,away now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that I've got you in my embrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You no longer have the\Nstrength to break free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly but surely, my icy body will drain\Nyour power until there's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, your heart will freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's snowing heavily all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What tremendous power he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But that tumble is going to land\Nhim in the trash chute which
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,leads straight to the garbage\Ndump that's deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to make it up\Nhere again unless he could fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He dug his own grave so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't eat anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad for you I know it's\Nhard, but resist the temptation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting past me, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you go\Nback inside the distant room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just eating a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, you're hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I didn't mean to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way, you monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We want our candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop them without hurting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's our jam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the biscuit room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of there, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The effects of the rumble\Nball are wearing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can eat all the candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the biscuit room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to have some!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That stuff's bad for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak, I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobanosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't handle them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to tell us\Nwhat's going on, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar Cloud's trying to\Nturn the four children into
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,giants because he wants them\Nall to become vicious soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's doing it by\Ngiving them drugged candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop the kids before\Nthey can consume any more of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The biscuit room's down\Nthe hall to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where they get the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a girl named Mocha\Nwho's been helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the only child\Nwho's in their right mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been working together to keep the\Nothers from getting back in the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but now she's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been protecting the\Ncandy, and she's all by herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta help, Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mil-flu, gigantesco model!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't hold\Nthem off much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure are determined to\Nget their hands on that stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have any, can't you\Nsee it's bad for you? Candy! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you guys this\Nis what's making us sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what did they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We asked Chopper and his friends to\Nhelp us get out of this place, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine! Give it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you gotta listen to them\Nor we'll never get back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, they're too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll tell you pretty things\Nwe've got to be in the mouth, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry\Nabout a thing, Mocha, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Monet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who the hell is she? Ah! It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the crazy bird woman\NI told you guys about!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha, you shouldn't hog all of the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a nice girl and share\Nit with the others, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Vroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my heart, come back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the counter-shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a message from Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that it's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew exactly how to get\Nmy heart back from Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have guessed you were his lackey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have better things to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Fargo? Mr. Fargo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it have to be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Been mean to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only look at trash for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,before I have to take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially filthy pirates like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They look mighty ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They are, but that's not your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want the rank and file to\Nknow the truth about you. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,These men, they look up\Nto you like a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out that you're\Na traitor, they'll be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They know it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to them? You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I hit a nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting so worked up, Smoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're actually concerned\Nabout the welfare of those Navy misfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a base commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do what I want to my\Ngood-for-nothing subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it had to end this way,\Nbut now that you know my secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even care if you\Nare their base commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause once a unit leaves the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their commander who's\Nresponsible for keeping them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever lay a hand on my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place to step!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole place is burning\Nup! What now? Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab the injured and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, come on, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to protect Toshiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't agree with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our foe! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's total crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are free to love who they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, Blackleg, You look so\Ncool fighting fake Vergo back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then watching you blast him like\Nthat made my heart skip a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was pretty sexy if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut your traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not really helping\Nme out here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like he's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget he's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, the tank just exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And it smoked fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It busted a hole in the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, another explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on? Come on! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See that purple stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the poisonous gas from outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Start running if you want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas is traveling fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before the\Nwhole building is filled!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running, Tashigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop to think or you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here as fast as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Blackleg! Let's go, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the pace or\Nyou're not gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have to lift a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, those fools brought\Nland of the dead inside for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My life demonstration is not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the gates to C and\ND! Yes, sir. What about R?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that one open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't have them getting lost, so we'll\Nlure them to the building's first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're looking for gate R-66, and\Nthe layout of this lab is confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't want them going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just have to guide them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I loathe this stupid secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But once we're done, I'll be free and\NI'll never have to come here again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have\Noverstayed their welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's time for them\Nto be properly punished
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got Joker on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I have the opportunity\Nto kill all of them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,in the ideal manner Master\Nwe're awaiting orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready for combat Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but may I ask why you've summoned\Nus here to Vega punks former
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,command room Wasn't he responsible\Nfor the accident four years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a score to settle with him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.34,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we wasting time standing\Naround here staring at each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, should we be fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You gentlemen are my backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best soldiers I have,\Nso I cannot risk losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, allow me to explain\Nthe plan to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before, once the gates\Nto C and D have been closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the only open routes\Nthrough the laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,will lead to the first\Nfloor of building R,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,which is directly beneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats, G5, the children,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter whether\Nthey're friend or foe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the survivors in the lab\Nwill be forced into that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The first floor has external vents\Nwhich can bring in outside air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we'll be able to\Nfill the room with land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be no way for them to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be stuck breathing that air!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be like a giant gas chamber!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon, they will all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The best part is we'll be\Nbroadcasting it so my shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,brokers in the new world\Ncan witness the slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they'll respect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll know my greatness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask this, but Master Caesar,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to doubt you or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,sir, but did you create\Nthe deadly poison gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems a lot like Vegapunk's gas,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the one from the accident four\Nyears ago, and thing is, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,it freaks us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just allow me to explain everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It still haunts me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I tried to stop the mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What if this dangerous\Nweapon exploded, I cried!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think of all the innocent\Npeople who would be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Vegapunk, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was no stopping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's the head of the\Nnavy science division and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,he's widely considered the\Nworld's greatest scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How could someone so heartless come\Nto be praised as the best of all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me after what he's\Ndone—does he still?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,still I'll deserve to\Nbe called the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I must prove him wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to create\Na weapon of mass murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid it must be\Ndone in order to prove I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest scientist in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the navy realizes that I\Ndeserve to be their lead scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be fulfilled and I shall use\Nmy knowledge to bring peace and unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, forgive me, master you're\Nright; how could I doubt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the god of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're putting everyone\Non the island in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize if that weapon explodes,\Ninnocent life will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.07,0:19:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignorant fool—this is a\Nmilitary testing site.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As you may know, the navy wants to kill\Nas many pirates as they possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm simply creating a new weapon\Nfor them, designed to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your weapon will kill pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but you know what else it'll\Ndo—kill a bunch of civilians, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See that's something\Ncalled collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't evacuate,\Nthey deserve what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe them all out, and we'll\Nfinally have world peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How could
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you say that, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cruel perhaps, but so are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,are you Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using the prisoners\Nas your guinea pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there really a difference between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku may be soft, but\NAdmiral Aka-Inu, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he would love one of my weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you interrupting my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's just jealous,\Nand I can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, his silly human enlargement\Nexperiment is nothing but a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be a real magician to make the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,human body grow that much\Nin such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell him what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What he needs is children.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who are growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And fill them with drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.20,0:20:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost finished making a weapon\Nso powerful it's beyond comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk, I demand to\Nknow the meaning of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been terminated from\Nthe science division, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gone too far this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cover for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:21:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Closing the gate between C and B.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate between D and B is now closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The passageways between buildings B,\NC, and D have been secured, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, run like hell, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.18,0:21:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the one who should\Nbe asking that of you!
